@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `nii-il33-nouns`
IMPORT `nii-il33-readings`
IMPORT `nii-rounding-regulations`
IMPORT `nii-il33-published-figures`
IMPORT `nii-s1-updating-clause`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests: the updating clause of s 1 "הסכום הבסיסי". Row IL-33.
--
-- HOW THE EXPECTED VALUES WERE WORKED. For each 1 January the rise is the later November index over the earlier
-- (in the earlier base), read from the CBS file; the amount of the previous year, raised by it and rounded to
-- whole shekels (regulation 4), is the new amount. Worked by hand, year by year, and written beside the group.
-- The ratios (later / earlier), to six places:
--   2016 101.184/102.1 = 0.99103 (a fall)   2017 98.9/99.2 = 0.99698 (a fall)   2018 99.1967/98.9 = 1.00300
--   2019 101.5/100.3 = 1.01196              2020 101.808/101.5 = 1.00303          2021 100.2/100.8 = 0.99405 (a fall)
--   2022 102.6069/100.2 = 1.02402           2023 107.7/102.3 = 1.05279            2024 111.3009/107.7 = 1.03343
--   2025 (frozen)                           2026 111.2664/108.7 = 1.02361
-- THE FIRST AMOUNT, 150 (paragraph (2)(a)), on the reading that a fall leaves the amount as it was:
--   2016 150 (fall)  2017 150 (fall)  2018 150 x 1.00300 = 150.45 -> 150  2019 150 x 1.01196 = 151.79 -> 152
--   2020 152 x 1.00303 = 152.46 -> 152  2021 152 (fall)  2022 152 x 1.02402 = 155.65 -> 156
--   2023 156 x 1.05279 = 164.24 -> 164  2024 164 x 1.03343 = 169.48 -> 169  2025 169 (frozen, as on 1.1.2024)
--   2026 169 x 1.02361 = 172.99 -> 173.
-- THE SECOND, 188 (2)(b): 2018 188.56 -> 189; 2019 189 x 1.01196 = 191.26 -> 191; 2020 191 x 1.00303 = 191.58 -> 192;
--   2022 192 x 1.02402 = 196.61 -> 197; 2023 197 x 1.05279 = 207.40 -> 207; 2024 207 x 1.03343 = 213.92 -> 214;
--   2026 214 x 1.02361 = 219.05 -> 219.
-- THE THIRD, 140 (2)(c): 2018 140.42 -> 140; 2019 140 x 1.01196 = 141.67 -> 142; 2020 142 x 1.00303 = 142.43 -> 142;
--   2022 142 x 1.02402 = 145.41 -> 145; 2023 145 x 1.05279 = 152.65 -> 153; 2024 153 x 1.03343 = 158.12 -> 158;
--   2026 158 x 1.02361 = 161.73 -> 162.
-- The printed notes of the Law (lines 187-189): 169 / 214 / 158 for 2024-2025 and 173 / 219 / 162 for 2026: the
-- reading that a fall leaves the amount as it was reproduces all six, and the other reading does not (below).
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — the clause`

§§ `The reading that a fall leaves the amount as it was: every year from 2015 to 2026`
